{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And he placed it in a coffin.</b> But he did not bury him, for they were destined to bring him up." "<b>And he placed.</b> Like ויושם, on the pattern of על בשר אדם לא יוסך." "<b>In a coffin.</b> The bet with a qamatz — to teach you that in his lifetime they chose it for him and prepared it. For none of the other patriarchs is a coffin mentioned. May the order of the parashah of Va-yehi be well; the book of Genesis is completed, with the help of HaShem."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:29.968171206Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}